# Peragus, T3-M4 alone (TSL, 106PER and 103PER): from the hangar bay down
# to the fuel depot's sublevel for parts and mines, a mine on the cargo
# hold's door, Hangar 25's console, the blast door to the fuel depot and
# the fuel control station's emergency hatch; HK-50 shuts T3 down and play
# goes back to the Exile. Starts from the administration level's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @peragus_t3 data/routes/tsl/peragus_t3.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "T3's Grand Adventure" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
# T3 in the hangar bay (DSimpson's "T3's Grand Adventure"): the two
# footlockers and the broken droid, then the left door and the ramp down.
unlock MilLowFootLker@1
use MilLowFootLker@1
unlock MilLowFootLker@3
use MilLowFootLker@3
use LowBroknDrd@1
equip
unlock PeragusDoor1@5 # the left door, locked: T3's Security
fight 20             # the two droids past it
exit Door_to_103PER2 # the ramp's bottom door: the fuel depot's sublevel
use LowBroknDrd@4    # its broken droid: components
fight 20
use LowCorpse@2      # the corpse: a datapad, an ion striker, mines
use LowBroknDrd@1    # parts for the hangar console
equip
exit DOOR_103PER2    # back up to the hangar
fight 25             # the droids back on the ramps, shields up
mine BlastDoor       # a mine on the sealed door (3C-FD behind it)
use Cylinder1
use Cylinder2
unlock MilLowFootLker@2
use MilLowFootLker@2
# The lower door and up the ramp to Hangar 25's console (the Ebon Hawk in
# its bay): the two footlockers, then the console.
unlock PeragusDoor1@6 # the lower door, locked: T3 slides through
unlock MilLowPlstcCylin@2 # up the ramp: two locked containers (DC 18)
use MilLowPlstcCylin@2
unlock MilLowPlstcCylin@3
use MilLowPlstcCylin@3
say replace the missing parts # [Repair] the console first takes its parts
say emergency control commands # [Repair] the diagnostic reroutes the
say run diagnostic   # missing parts; [Computer] the emergency
say check status of emergency # sub-systems: open the blast door to the
say open blast door to the fuel depot # fuel depot (a spike)
say return to main functions
say access hangar logs # docking and takeoff procedures: the download
say docking and takeoff # fails
say transmit
say download
say log out
use HangarTer
exit Door_to_103PER  # down the ramp: the blast door open, into the depot
fight 20             # the hallway's droids, the ion striker's work
# (the broken droid and footlocker on the way: not found by tag, skipped)
fight 20
say emergency system schematics # the fuel control station: open the
say open emergency hatch # emergency hatch on the administration level
use ComputerPanel
talk                 # HK-50 zaps T3
module 101per        # back to the Exile and Atton
save peragus_hatch
